{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Find, reach, take and check object, perform specific task if possible, then move to next location if needed. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToNextLocation    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = PerformSpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectReached    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectFound    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    />",
